<!-- Static DOM retained for existing feature runtime. Keep IDs and classes stable. -->
<template>
<section v-pre id="backupsView" class="view backup-page">
          <div class="page-heading backup-page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">DATABASE ADMINISTRATION</p><h2>Database Backup</h2><p class="lede">Buat, unduh, dan restore backup database PostgreSQL.</p></div><div class="csf-actions backup-primary-action"><button class="button button-accent" id="backupCreateButton" type="button">Create backup</button><span class="file-count" id="backupCount">0 backups</span></div></div>
          <label for="backupPartSizeMb">Ambang pembagian backup (MiB per bagian)</label><input id="backupPartSizeMb" type="number" min="1" max="10240" step="1" value="500"><p class="muted">Backup yang melebihi ambang otomatis dibagi. Unduh manifest dan seluruh bagian; pilih semuanya saat restore. Bagian yang hilang atau rusak akan ditolak.</p>
          <p class="muted">Backup lengkap mencakup seluruh schema, tabel, data semua modul termasuk Asset Management beserta foto asli aset/rak, akun, permission, pengaturan, audit log, serta struktur database aplikasi. File evidence/upload dicadangkan melalui File Backup. Kunci konfigurasi server dicadangkan secara terpisah. Backup JSON lama hanya berisi data tabel.</p>
          <div class="backup-restore-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">RECOVERY CONTROL</p><h3>Restore database</h3><p class="muted">Restore mengganti data database saat ini. File .dump besar didukung tanpa batas ukuran tetap dari aplikasi; kapasitas mengikuti ruang disk server. Gunakan file backup yang dibuat aplikasi ini.</p></div><div class="backup-restore-actions"><label class="button button-quiet" for="backupRestoreInput">Tambah file backup / bagian<input id="backupRestoreInput" type="file" multiple hidden></label><button id="backupRestoreClearButton" type="button" class="button button-quiet" hidden>Kosongkan pilihan</button><span class="muted" id="backupRestoreFileName">No file selected</span><button class="button button-danger" id="backupRestoreButton" type="button" disabled>Restore selected backup</button></div></div>
          <p class="muted">Pilih manifest dan semua bagian sekaligus dengan Ctrl/Shift, atau klik Tambah file berulang kali. File yang sudah dipilih tetap tersimpan dalam daftar.</p>
          <ul id="backupRestoreQueue" class="upload-selected-files" aria-label="Daftar file database untuk dipulihkan" hidden></ul>
          <ul id="backupSelectedFiles" class="upload-selected-files" aria-label="File database yang dipilih untuk restore" hidden></ul>
          <div id="backupProgressPanel" class="backup-operation-progress" hidden><div class="upload-progress-heading"><strong data-progress-label>Menyiapkan...</strong><span data-progress-percent>0%</span></div><progress max="100" value="0" aria-label="Progres Database Backup"></progress><p class="upload-progress-detail" data-progress-detail role="status"></p></div>
          <a id="backupReloginLink" class="button button-accent" href="/login" hidden>Login kembali setelah restore</a>
          <div class="section-heading backup-archive-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BACKUP ARCHIVE</p><h3>Available database backups</h3><p class="muted" id="backupStatus">Backup hanya dapat diakses administrator.</p></div></div>
          <div class="excel-wrap backup-archive-table"><table class="excel-table"><thead><tr><th>File</th><th>Created</th><th>Size</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="backupBody"></tbody></table></div>
        </section>
</template>
